OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised over 'disastrous'
OL,4,Awaste centre plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised over the
OL,7,Fproposed location of a new household
OL,8,Fwaste centre.
OL,10,FMembers of Chesterton Parish Council
OL,11,Fsaid the new tip, planned for land in
OL,12,FOxfordshire between their village and
OL,13,FBicester, would risk losing the buffer
OL,14,Fseparating the communities.
OL,16,FVolunteers from the Friends of
OL,17,FBurnehyll Community Woodland also fear
OL,18,Flosing some of the 10,000 saplings
OL,19,Fplanted on green space neighbouring the
OL,20,Fsite.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
